config.cavesandcliffsbackport.lush.tooltip=O musgo, a azaleia, as trepadeiras das cavernas e as bagas brilhantes, as plantaformas, as flores de esporos, o líquen brilhante, a terra enraizada, as raízes suspensas e as cavernas verdejantes.
